22. Thus, to prove the case against the accused, the prosecution was obliged to prove the following ingredients: -
--That both the accused assaulted or used criminal force to public servant to desist him from his duty as such public servant;
-That they caused the hurt to Sub Registrar -That they voluntarily obstructed the public servant in the discharge of his public functions;
-That they committed the aforesaid offences in furtherance of their common intention.
23.
